-- 1) one vault is created per vendor_branch
-- 2) vault_code is generated deterministically as VLT_<branch_code>
-- 3) vault type defaults to 'ATM_CASH' because source data does not distinguish ATM-only vs cash-only vaults
-- 4) amount, max_capacity_amount, and min_capacity_amount are left NULL because source data does not provide branch vault balances/capacities
-- 5) currency_code defaults to 'IDR' and is_active defaults to true
